{"id": 1010380, "slug": "dungeons-of-eternity", "name": "Dungeons of Eternity", "name_original": "Dungeons of Eternity", "description": "<p>Endless fantasy action and adventure await you and your friends in Dungeons of Eternity. </p><p>Hack-n-slash takes on a new meaning in VR: swing swords, throw axes, use bows, wield magic staffs, and more to make it out alive. </p><h3>COOP OR SOLO PLAY</h3><p>Band together for an unforgettable cooperative experience with up to 4 players, or delve into the dungeons yourself. </p><h3>EVER-CHANGING DUNGEONS</h3><p>Explore randomly-generated dungeons across multiple game modes and realms - no dungeon run is the same. A vast array of chambers await, from combat arenas, puzzle and trap rooms, secret chambers, and more. </p><h3>FEEL THE DUNGEONS</h3><p>Hack-n-slash like never before with a visceral physics-based combat system and realistic interactions with the game world. </p><h3>ENDLESS ARSENAL</h3><p>Every weapon is randomly generated, offering nearly endless loot within the dungeons. You will discover many weapon types, including swords, bows, magic staffs, and more.</p><p> </p><h3>PLAY YOUR WAY</h3><p>Craft your playstyle and appearance through loadouts, upgrades, and a diverse set of character customization options.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-09-11", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-09-12T12:21:07", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8f9/8f9170f3e53d5daa26198271798bfdd7.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/95a/95adf64ac6ff70d7ae44be599de2c908.jpg", "website": "https://www.othergate.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 4, "added_by_status": {"owned": 1, "toplay": 3}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 13, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 30, "parent_achievements_count": 30, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo":